{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Pensamento do jogador + Fazer café  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "Vou precisar de ajuda de alguém.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "Espero que a Mita não morda...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "O que é que estou a fazer da minha vida...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Jogador tenta acordar MitaDreamer**  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "Mita?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "Mita, acorda!  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "Mita!  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "Mita, toca a acordar!  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "Preciso da tua ajuda.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "Quem és tuuuuu?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "Ajuda-me com os interruptores.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "Que interruptores?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "Deixa-me dormir...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "Ou vai buscar-me um cafézinho.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "A máquina de café está ali.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "Mita?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "Mi-ita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Jogador dá o café**  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "Mita,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "aqui está o teu café.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// Exercício de MitaDreamer**  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "Interruptores,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "disseste?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "Sim.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "Como é que sabes disso?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "Mas, por que é que pergunto sequer...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "Considerando que estás aqui,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "já deves saber bastante...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "Só um minuto,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "preciso sentar-me.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "E?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "Não sei o que dizer...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "Mas preciso de continuar"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "a seguir a orientação do anel.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "Tens o anel dela?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "Não me admira "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "que tenhas encontrado este lugar.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "Exato.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "Então, podes ajudar-me?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "Com os interruptores?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "Claro.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "Vou ajudar-te.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "Com os interruptores...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "Mita, vamos lá...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "Já vamos.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "Uh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "Está bem.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "Vamos.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// MitaDreamer cai"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "Levanta-te.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "Estás assim tão sonolenta?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// MitaDreamer volta a dormir  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "Acorda.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "Já chegámos.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Interruptores  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "Está bem,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "estou pronta.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "Estou pronto também.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "Bem.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "Vou começar  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "a contagem crescente.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "E vamos puxar os interruptores juntos.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "Está bem?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "Mantém-te só acordada, OK?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "Vai.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Jogador perde 1  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "Estás a prestar atenção?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "Vamos lá,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "vamos de novo...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Jogador perde 2  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "Mais uma tentativa?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "Vamos,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "eu...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "estou a adormecer aqui...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Jogador perde 3  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "Estou quase a adormecer...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "Maravilhoso,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "obrigado, Mita.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "Mm-hmm.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "As portas...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "tão...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "lentas...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "Vou para a cama...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Porquê cozinha?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "Porque é que vais para a cozinha?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "Se eu adormecer no chão frio,  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "a culpa é tua.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Porquê casa de banho?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "Não percebo...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "com que interruptores é que precisavas de ajuda?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Colocar botão  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "Não aconteceu nada?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "Então, o que é que este botão faz aqui?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Café  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "Mais café?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "Ou vais adormecer outra vez.  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "O quê?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "Nãããão...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "Este café tem um sabor horrível...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "Estou totalmente bem...  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Botão "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "Mita? O botão não funciona... Ouves-me?  "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "Olá?"}
